        <mxCell id="logic-habits-meta" value="metadata.fields&#10;defines log keys" style="endArrow=open;startArrow=none;endFill=0;html=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#888888;exitX=1;exitY=0.6;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.85;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;rounded=0;fontSize=10;edgeStyle=none;curved=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="habits" target="hlogs">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="380" y="315" />
              <mxPoint x="380" y="657" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&#10;&#8226; &lt;b&gt;Composite primary keys&lt;/b&gt; are marked PK1, PK2 in order. &lt;b&gt;habit_logs&lt;/b&gt; PK = (habit_id, date_iso). &lt;b&gt;time_blocks&lt;/b&gt; PK = (date_iso, quarter).&#10;&#10;&#8226; &lt;b&gt;time_blocks&lt;/b&gt; is a fixed-grid time series. No SQL FK to subjects: a 15-min quarter is just (date, quarter, utilization). Subject attribution is computed post-hoc by intersecting (date.weekday, quarter) with subject_blocks (day_of_week, [start..end]).&#10;&#10;&#8226; &lt;b&gt;habits.metadata&lt;/b&gt; (JSON) shape: {&amp;quot;fields&amp;quot;: [{&amp;quot;key&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;PU&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;type&amp;quot;: &amp;quot;number&amp;quot;}]}. &lt;b&gt;habit_logs.metadata&lt;/b&gt; (JSON) shape: {&amp;quot;PU&amp;quot;: 25}. The fields list on the habit is the schema for the value map on its logs.&#10;&#10;&#8226; &lt;b&gt;subject_blocks.pomodoro_*&lt;/b&gt; columns survive from v3 but are ignored at runtime since pomodoro became a universal setting (Settings only).&#10;&#10;&#8226; Indexes: idx_habit_logs_date, idx_time_blocks_date, idx_subject_blocks_subject, idx_subject_blocks_day.&#10;&#10;&#8226; PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON is set per connection (sqflite default is OFF, which silently ignores ON DELETE CASCADE)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cccccc;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="710" width="1480" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
